[00:12.44] To see you when I wake up
[00:16.39] Is a gift I didn't think could be real
[00:25.09] To know that you feel the same as I do
[00:30.35] Is a three fold Utopian dream
[00:37.44] You do something to me
[00:42.11] That I can't explain
[00:49.53] So, would I be out of line
[00:54.36] If I said, "I miss you"?
[01:04.46] 
[01:26.65] I see your picture I smell your skin
[01:30.85] On the empty pillow next to mine
[01:36.15] 
[01:38.90] You have only been gone ten days
[01:44.06] But already I'm wasting away
[01:51.10] I know I'll see you again
[01:56.09] Whether far or soon
[02:03.76] But I need you to know
[02:08.38] That I care and I miss you
[02:17.45] 
[02:33.57] I miss you
[02:34.87] 